{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫劇《璀璨之城》為慶祝萬聖節，一眾演員搞搞新意思，扮鬼扮馬雲集TVB大玩鬥智鬥力《狼人殺》，出席演員包括張智霖、吳卓羲、高海寧、張曦雯、江美儀、陳瀅、蔣家旻、周志康、倪嘉雯、孔德賢，黃子恆擔任MC。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.810012+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T07:57:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T03:58:19.123797+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771179+00:00","content_hash":"69beb7d1738a7738c371ccf5066f5ff201bb19800937d71aaae68c3b30f8f5f4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}